   "title": "Try this",
   "html": "<p>A Python list can add to its end with <code>append</code>, and remove and return its last item with <code>pop</code>. For <code>pop</code> and <code>peek</code>, check <code>is_empty()</code> first so an empty stack gives back <code>None</code>. For <code>size</code>, use the built-in that counts items.</p>\n"
  },
